    <Name>Nebraska's Official Veterans Day Parade 2026</Name>
    <DisplayFlags />
    <Status>APPROVED</Status>
    <Description>&lt;h1&gt;Nebraska’s Official Veterans Day Parade&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:20px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Honoring Those Who Served&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;For years, the Bellevue community has come together to honor the men and women who have served; and continue to serve, our nation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Join us for &lt;strong&gt;Nebraska’s Official Veterans Day Parade&lt;/strong&gt;, a Bellevue tradition that brings veterans, active-duty military, families, businesses, organizations, community groups and patriotic supporters together for a day of gratitude, remembrance and celebration.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Whether you are a veteran, military organization, business, school, nonprofit, civic group or simply a proud American who wants to be part of this special tradition, &lt;strong&gt;we invite you to march, ride, drive or participate in the parade!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Be Part of the Parade&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Show your support for our veterans by entering a float, vehicle, marching group, military unit, organization or other patriotic entry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Parade participation is a wonderful way to:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread="false"&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Honor veterans and active-duty service members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Showcase your organization to thousands of spectators&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Celebrate our community’s strong military connection&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Bring employees, families and friends together for a meaningful event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Be part of a Bellevue tradition that has continued for &lt;strong&gt;decades&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Sponsorships are available&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;br style="box-sizing: border-box;"/&gt;
&lt;span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 20px;"&gt;&lt;span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"&gt;Please include narrative in the comments section of your registration&lt;/span&gt;. &lt;span style="box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;"&gt;&lt;u style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;&lt;span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);"&gt;Narratives can be a *maximum* of 50 words.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/&gt;
&lt;br style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"/&gt;
&lt;span style="box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;"&gt;&lt;u style="box-sizing: border-box;"&gt;Parade Entry Fees:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br style="box-sizing: border-box;"/&gt;
$30 - Chamber members (including nonprofits)&lt;br style="box-sizing: border-box;"/&gt;
$60 - Non-Chamber members (including nonprofits)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br style="box-sizing: border-box;"/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;No Charge - Active Duty, Veterans &amp;amp; Veterans Organizations. – entry form is required&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span style="font-size:16px;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Dignitary Breakfast&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;u&gt;Honoring Our Grand Marshal&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;Before the parade, join community leaders, military representatives, veterans and special guests at our &lt;strong&gt;Dignitary Breakfast&lt;/strong&gt;, a distinguished gathering honoring the year's &lt;strong&gt;Grand Marshal&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:14px;"&gt;The breakfast provides an opportunity to recognize an individual whose service, leadership and dedication represent the spirit of Veterans Day.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px;"&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One Community. A Grateful Nation.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;Nebraska’s Official Veterans Day Parade has provided our community with an opportunity to come together and say &lt;strong&gt;thank you&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class="isSelectedEnd"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;November 7, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Nebraska’s Official Veterans Day Parade&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;Bellevue, Nebraska&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Honor. Remember. Celebrate.&lt;/h3&gt;
</Description>
