    <Description>&lt;div style='font-family: "Segoe UI"; line-height: 20px;'&gt;&lt;strong style="font-size: 14px;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:20px;"&gt;RIBBON CUTTING and GRAND OPENING at Thanksgiving Church newly expanded &amp;amp; renovated Community Center&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
 
&lt;div data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody" dir="ltr" style="border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 14px 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;Join us in celebrating the &lt;b&gt;Grand Opening and Ribbon Cutting &lt;/b&gt;of Thanksgiving Church's newly expanded and renovated Community Center. This milestone represents a significant investment in their mission to serve our community, support our neighbors, and share the love of Jesus. &lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div dir="ltr" style="border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-variant-alternates: inherit; font-variant-position: inherit; font-variant-emoji: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 12pt; line-height: inherit; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-optical-sizing: inherit; font-size-adjust: inherit; font-kerning: inherit; font-feature-settings: inherit; font-variation-settings: inherit; font-language-override: inherit; margin: 14px 0px; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"&gt;For nearly 2 years, this transformational project has included renovated worship spaces, modernized facilities, expanded classrooms, and enhanced community support areas that added approximately 24,000 square feet to their existing facility. Thanksgiving Church &lt;span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 14px 0px;"&gt;would be honored by your presence as they celebrate this exciting new chapter and dedicate these facilities to worshipping God and serving the community for years to come. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;!--EndFragment--&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;span data-olk-copy-source="MessageBody" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Aptos, Aptos_EmbeddedFont, Aptos_MSFontService, Calibri, Helvetica, sans-serif; white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 20px 0px;"&gt;Following the ribbon cutting and consecration ceremony, a light lunch will be served, providing an opportunity for fellowship and celebration and walking tours of the updated spaces. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
